<title>USA: Russellville SD 14, Ark., won by First Tennessee.</title>
<headline>Russellville SD 14, Ark., won by First Tennessee.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Tennessee Bank said it won $3.240 million of Russellville SD 14, Ark., refunding limited tax bonds, Series B, with a net interest cost of 4.938  percent.</p>
</text>
